sequenceDiagram
  participant UI
  participant SDK
  participant Native
  participant Server

  UI->>SDK: Trigger entity fetch
  SDK->>Server: GET /entities?include=files
  Server-->>SDK: JSON with file URLs
  SDK->>Native: walkAndPersistFiles -> download & store
  SDK->>UI: return entities with file keys
  Note over Native,SDK: On offline, SDK reads native cache and returns data URIs to UI